  (text "Encoder interface - four 0.5 mm FFCs, one per leaf, to the LX34311 sensor boards (COL-COTS-0016). Contract: VIN 4-6 V from VM, GND, SIG open-drain pulled to +3V3 here (10k), spare unassigned. Vault: Main-Board-01 Encoder Interface / Connectors. Motor pads are on the MotorChannel sheet; supply pads on Power."
